%% Editable source for models/navigation.svg (Mermaid). Arrows = permitted navigation routes, not business state transitions.
flowchart LR
  subgraph BUYER
    B1[Browse produce] --> B2[Order form]
    B2 <-->|back preserves values| B3[Review - not yet sent]
    B3 --> B4[Order outcome: reference + status]
    B4 --> B5[Order status]
    B6[My orders] <-->|open item / return to list| B5
    B6 -->|start new| B1
  end
  subgraph FARMER[FARMER - separate permission context]
    F1[Incoming orders - own listings only] <-->|open / return| F2[Order detail: accept / decline]
    F2 --> F3[Decision outcome: new status shown]
    F3 --> F1
  end
